+  // kUnsignedTwoBytes, kUnsignedByte. Orders: kRelaxedNonAtomic (bare loop),
+  // kRelease (lwsync before), kAcquire (lwsync after, on the success and the
+  // mismatch path). Between larx and stcx. there is no storage access and no
