+//
+// GENERATED SHELL (work/il/tools/gen-shells.py) from il_riscv.cc of
+// Dart 3.11.5: every body is UNIMPLEMENTED() until its owner fills it
+// in (M3-BOOT-PLAN sections 4 and 7). il_ppc64_a.cc, _b.cc and _c.cc
+// are disjoint and are concatenated into il_ppc64.cc when the patch
+// series is cut. Templates: il_arm64.cc for structure and raw register
+// names through the bijection, il_riscv.cc for overflow, int32 handling
+// and the deferred compare (ABI-SPEC 2.3).
+//
+// Cross-agent contracts (M3-BOOT-PLAN section 7): the identical stub
+// returns TMP == 0; CallRuntime uses r8/r7, native stubs r8/r5/r4; FFI
+// target in r15, r21 = saved SP; every C call is CallCFunction;
+// overflow is never a Condition; one BranchIf/SetIf per compare; no
+// value is "undefined above bit 31"; no intrinsics, SIMD or peepholes.
